        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur GEOEDNCOM, Eden Prairie Knobset With Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Eden Prairie Knobset With Single Cylinder Deadbolt is the perfect finishing touch to colonial home restorations. A prime example of traditional decor that still has a fitting place among today's world, this knob and deadbolt combo features the egg knob and stepped rose that gives it such a classic appeal. This Grandeur Entry Door Combo Pack includes a high security single cylinder deadbolt meaning it is operated by a key on the outside of the door and by a thumbturn on the inside. The Georgetown Rosette with Eden Prairie Knob and Matching Deadbolt fits doors 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. It is easy to install and comes backed by a 10 year finish warranty and a lifetime mechanical warranty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-georgetown-series\"><b>Georgetown Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur GEOEDNCOM Eden Prairie Knob With Deadbolt:\r\n</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Eden Prairie Knobset With Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Eden Prairie Knob Height: 2.68\"</li>\r\n<li>Eden Prairie Knob Width: 1.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Eden Prairie Knob Projection: 2.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Georgetown Rosette Diameter: 2.69\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Diameter: 2.69\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt  Projection: 0.72\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.65\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder Projection: 0.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EDN-knob.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Eden Prairie Knob Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GEO-rose.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Georgetown Rosette Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GEO-deadbolt.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Georgetown Deadbolt Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
